{
  "name": "Avatar of Peace (Peace Domain)",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You radiate a soothing, unseeable aura in a 30-foot Emanation that originates from you. The aura is inactive while you have the Incapacitated condition.</p><p>All allied creatures in the aura are Immune to the Frightened condition. If a Frightened ally enters the aura, that condition has no effect on that ally while there.</p><p>Any hostile creature in the aura that targets you or your allies with an attack or other harmful effect takes psychic damage equal to half your cleric level (rounded down).</p>",
